# Ripgrep (.ignore) defense-in-depth for OpenCode V2 grep/glob tools
# OpenCode V2 runs ripgrep with `--no-config --hidden`, which still honors `.ignore`
# during directory searches even when files are untracked or outside `.gitignore`.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template

*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*id_rsa*
*id_ed25519*
.aws/
.ssh/
secrets/
*credentials*
